3074
03:25:47,320 --> 03:25:47,760
Weird.

3075
03:25:49,760 --> 03:25:50,200
Okay.

3076
03:25:51,840 --> 03:25:53,220
Why you gotta stand on that?

3077
03:25:53,760 --> 03:25:54,540
Come on now.

3078
03:25:57,980 --> 03:25:58,420
Mending.

3079
