3083
03:26:08,120 --> 03:26:08,800
The fuck?

3084
03:26:10,260 --> 03:26:11,720
Alright, well this should help immensely.

3085
03:26:12,720 --> 03:26:14,220
This is a huge upgrade now.

3086
03:26:19,020 --> 03:26:38,040
Do-do-do-do-do-do-do-do-

3087
03:26:51,400 --> 03:26:52,140
How's that looking?

3088
