Maybe there are certain breakpoints where if you get efficiency 3, that's when, you know, you can really feel it.

3105
03:28:09,260 --> 03:28:09,920
Very good.

3106
03:28:12,520 --> 03:28:13,900
I think it's a little bit faster.

3107
