And then we could have, like, rest stops in between.

3124
03:30:33,070 --> 03:30:33,810
Or something.

3125
03:30:33,950 --> 03:30:34,310
I don't know.

3126
03:30:35,410 --> 03:30:36,130
Gotta think about it.

3127
03:30:43,290 --> 03:30:45,630
Definitely need more attractions along the way.

3128
03:30:45,970 --> 03:30:47,550
Like little outposts.

3129
03:30:51,780 --> 03:30:52,160
Wow!

3130
03:30:54,040 --> 03:30:55,380
Okay, I got a lot of sand now.

3131
03:30:55,660 --> 03:30:56,200
I think we're good.

3132
