Hold on, is that even a right saying?

3134
03:31:15,510 --> 03:31:16,750
And we're off to the races?

3135
03:31:17,510 --> 03:31:21,830
I feel like I've heard that somewhere before, and I feel like I made it in the correct context there, but I don't know.

3136
03:31:22,730 --> 03:31:23,350
Off we go!

3137
