But it is kind of a waste to use a bunch of rockets every time, unless you have a way of having infinite rockets, which I don't.

3140
03:31:42,070 --> 03:31:46,850
So, I'm going to have to rely on the good old railway system.

3141
03:31:47,210 --> 03:31:49,810
