Oh, you need coal.

3148
03:32:06,750 --> 03:32:07,510
Oh, my.

3149
03:32:16,920 --> 03:32:17,260
Sweet!

3150
03:32:17,260 --> 03:32:18,520
Did you see that right there?

3151
03:32:20,200 --> 03:32:22,600
Oh, if I shift-click... Okay!

3152
03:32:23,140 --> 03:32:23,480
Nice!

3153
03:32:23,660 --> 03:32:24,300
It's just a stat.

3154
