Actually, it doesn't make any sense that I would think that.

3157
03:32:35,160 --> 03:32:37,040
Okay, and this one is not cooking.

3158
03:32:38,560 --> 03:32:39,840
Everything is cooking.

3159
03:32:41,740 --> 03:32:43,380
Ooh, yeah, baby.

3160
