Are you ready?

3165
03:32:55,540 --> 03:32:55,940
Okay.

3166
03:32:57,500 --> 03:33:00,980
Guys, is it more than 200?

3167
03:33:01,300 --> 03:33:01,800
Yes or no?

3168
