Come on, let's make a prediction here.

3169
03:33:05,180 --> 03:33:06,280
More than 200?

3170
03:33:07,520 --> 03:33:08,380
Yes or no?

3171
03:33:09,040 --> 03:33:09,820
Are you ready?

3172
03:33:10,080 --> 03:33:11,920
I say yes.

3173
03:33:17,820 --> 03:33:18,380
What?

3174
03:33:18,700 --> 03:33:19,280
Hold on.

3175
03:33:20,120 --> 03:33:20,940
It's broken.

3176
03:33:21,140 --> 03:33:21,680
It's not working.

3177
03:33:22,620 --> 03:33:23,640
It's not working.

3178
03:33:25,300 --> 03:33:26,200
How the hell?

3179
03:33:27,380 --> 03:33:28,360
How the hell?

3180
03:33:32,340 --> 03:33:33,300
Something ain't right.

3181
03:33:33,620 --> 03:33:34,320
It's broken.

3182
