There's no way.

3183
03:33:50,040 --> 03:33:50,640
What?

3184
03:33:52,180 --> 03:33:54,700
I've been in my house so much today.

3185
03:34:01,540 --> 03:34:01,940
What?

3186
03:34:02,400 --> 03:34:08,860
Okay, I guess my mind is blown now, but... Disappointed!

3187
