3201
03:34:46,170 --> 03:34:49,830
We're gonna have daylight detector, okay?

3202
03:34:50,510 --> 03:34:56,910
Once every day, it activates a signal, it sends the cart off to the races, okay?

3203
03:34:57,570 --> 03:35:01,530
It arrives at the endpoint, and it sits... Oh, but wait, wait, wait.

3204
03:35:01,610 --> 03:35:01,890
No, no, no.

3205
03:35:02,350 --> 03:35:03,850
Yeah, it sits there for a while, right?

3206
03:35:03,930 --> 03:35:08,170
It sits there for a while, and it deposits everything into a box while it sits there.

3207
03:35:08,530 --> 03:35:13,810
And then the daylight detector switches around again when the day is starting, goes back.

3208
03:35:14,090 --> 03:35:19,390
So it automatically transports it back and forth, so I don't need to gym every single time.

3209
