3516
03:55:48,000 --> 03:55:50,680
You know, if you squint your eyes, it does look like everything's on fire.

3517
03:55:53,800 --> 03:55:54,580
Looks nice.

3518
03:55:54,940 --> 03:55:55,880
Looks real nice.

3519
03:55:56,200 --> 03:55:59,020
Definitely gonna have lights along the bridge here and everything.

3520
03:56:00,960 --> 03:56:02,340
It's gonna look dope.

3521
03:56:07,260 --> 03:56:09,420
Hey, what are you doing along my railway, huh?

3522
03:56:11,240 --> 03:56:12,260
What are you doing?

3523
03:56:20,420 --> 03:56:21,740
Nah, I need that experience.

3524
03:56:24,880 --> 03:56:25,740
That's a decent amount.

3525
03:56:25,840 --> 03:56:26,620
I get like one bar.

3526
03:56:28,380 --> 03:56:30,440
How much experience do these guys... I'm not gonna kill them.

3527
03:56:31,460 --> 03:56:32,520
I like them being there.

3528
03:56:32,860 --> 03:56:34,720
Also, that chest has been there since the start of the game.

3529
03:56:34,860 --> 03:56:35,800
May need to remove it soon.

3530
03:56:40,680 --> 03:56:41,000
Wow!

3531
03:56:58,580 --> 03:57:01,860
I think fighting with the sword is actually a bad idea in general.

3532
03:57:02,280 --> 03:57:06,160
The bow is just superior in damage, really.

3533
03:57:06,780 --> 03:57:07,780
It's safer.

3534
03:57:10,040 --> 03:57:11,320
And there's no downside.

3535
03:57:12,560 --> 03:57:13,840
You have infinite arrows.

3536
03:57:19,640 --> 03:57:20,580
Look at this.

3537
03:57:25,260 --> 03:57:26,340
Is this not the coolest?

3538
03:57:26,500 --> 03:57:29,140
I actually... Okay, one thing I'm going to try at one point, by the way.

3539
03:57:31,440 --> 03:57:33,480
I'm going to have shaders at some point, of course.

3540
03:57:33,660 --> 03:57:36,780
And I want to see how everything that I did here looks like.

3541
03:57:36,780 --> 03:57:38,020
What that looks like with shaders.

3542
03:57:38,080 --> 03:57:38,700
Hey, what's up, Rosie?

3543
03:57:39,240 --> 03:57:40,220
You shouldn't be down here.

3544
03:57:40,320 --> 03:57:41,880
This is a very restricted area.

3545
03:57:43,240 --> 03:57:43,640
Come here.

3546
03:57:44,580 --> 03:57:45,040
Follow me.

3547
03:57:47,060 --> 03:57:47,700
Okay, there you are.

3548
03:57:48,660 --> 03:57:49,680
You should get back into the village.

3549
03:57:49,680 --> 03:57:50,720
You cannot roam out here.

3550
03:57:50,800 --> 03:57:51,080
I'm sorry.

3551
03:57:52,310 --> 03:57:53,450
How did you get out here anyway?

3552
03:57:54,390 --> 03:57:55,890
You probably just teleported, didn't you?

3553
03:57:56,970 --> 03:57:57,790
Little cheater.

3554
03:57:58,990 --> 03:57:59,690
There you are.

3555
03:57:59,990 --> 03:58:01,070
Stay there for a bit, okay?

3556
03:58:01,550 --> 03:58:02,110
Keep guard.

3557
03:58:07,700 --> 03:58:10,980
These things are not done because they have not been simulating while I was gone.

3558
03:58:13,220 --> 03:58:16,580
Now that I have increased my RAM, maybe I should increase my simulation.

3559
03:58:18,160 --> 03:58:18,920
Let's see here.

3560
03:58:19,100 --> 03:58:19,340
Video.

3561
03:58:20,980 --> 03:58:22,480
Simulation distance chunks.

3562
03:58:22,720 --> 03:58:23,340
20 chunks.

3563
03:58:23,780 --> 03:58:25,020
Wonder how big a chunk is.

3564
03:58:26,600 --> 03:58:28,960
Let's put this on 32 as well.

3565
03:58:29,020 --> 03:58:30,380
Let's just have these equalized.

3566
03:58:31,060 --> 03:58:31,500
Apply.

3567
03:58:39,130 --> 03:58:39,490
Okay.

3568
03:58:41,370 --> 03:58:42,350
I don't feel a difference.

3569
03:58:43,730 --> 03:58:44,650
No difference at all.

3570
03:58:45,090 --> 03:58:45,550
Sup, Jane?

3571
03:58:46,690 --> 03:58:47,590
You've been farming, huh?

3572
03:58:50,070 --> 03:58:52,870
Maybe I want to give you some things to level you up.

3573
03:58:54,630 --> 03:58:55,390
I have money.

3574
03:58:57,350 --> 03:58:58,090
I have money.

3575
03:58:58,210 --> 03:58:58,930
I can give you money.

3576
03:59:00,710 --> 03:59:01,070
Actually.

3577
03:59:02,410 --> 03:59:03,230
Here you go, Jane.

3578
03:59:03,750 --> 03:59:04,550
Let's have some apples.

3579
03:59:10,280 --> 03:59:10,880
There.

3580
03:59:10,880 --> 03:59:12,000
The journeyman.

3581
03:59:13,120 --> 03:59:14,840
18 cookies?!

3582
03:59:14,840 --> 03:59:18,140
Whoa!

3583
03:59:18,660 --> 03:59:18,960
Hold on.

3584
03:59:19,200 --> 03:59:20,940
I forgot how good the cookies were.

3585
03:59:29,920 --> 03:59:31,420
Okay, so you give me a discount.

3586
03:59:37,320 --> 03:59:38,960
I'm taking all of your cookies.

3587
03:59:41,100 --> 03:59:42,440
Put the cookie down!

3588
03:59:43,680 --> 03:59:44,420
Come on.

3589
03:59:45,680 --> 03:59:46,840
Expert farmer!

3590
03:59:48,180 --> 03:59:49,700
You can make cakes now!

3591
03:59:52,780 --> 03:59:53,780
Do they stack?

3592
03:59:53,920 --> 03:59:54,580
They don't stack!

3593
03:59:56,400 --> 03:59:57,100
Hold on.

3594
04:00:03,980 --> 04:00:04,980
Cake is back here.

3595
04:00:05,420 --> 04:00:05,960
Come on, everybody!

3596
04:00:06,240 --> 04:00:07,020
Cake is served.

3597
04:00:08,040 --> 04:00:11,040
I shall name this the International Cake Day.

3598
04:00:11,620 --> 04:00:12,140
Okay?

3599
04:00:12,900 --> 04:00:14,180
Everyone has cake today.

3600
04:00:16,180 --> 04:00:18,780
And everyone can thank Jane for her hard work.

3601
04:00:19,240 --> 04:00:20,660
She is the one responsible.

3602
04:00:20,860 --> 04:00:21,800
She made these cakes.

3603
04:00:23,900 --> 04:00:24,840
It's gonna be great.

3604
04:00:27,620 --> 04:00:29,080
Goddamn, my inventory sucks.

3605
04:00:30,480 --> 04:00:31,860
Let's throw some stuff in there.

3606
04:00:33,980 --> 04:00:35,040
Keep this.

3607
04:00:35,440 --> 04:00:36,600
Take that back.

3608
04:00:36,800 --> 04:00:37,660
Put that in here now.

3609
04:00:39,520 --> 04:00:40,620
There we go.

3610
04:00:41,720 --> 04:00:42,280
Okay.

3611
04:00:42,600 --> 04:00:43,360
Here we go.

3612
04:00:44,520 --> 04:00:45,520
Like this.

3613
04:00:47,920 --> 04:00:49,100
Cakes for everyone.

3614
04:00:50,940 --> 04:00:51,820
Come go.

3615
04:00:52,100 --> 04:00:52,480
Get it.

3616
04:00:52,620 --> 04:00:52,880
Eat it.

3617
04:00:53,500 --> 04:00:54,900
It's cake day, everybody.

3618
04:00:58,980 --> 04:00:59,980
Put that over there.

3619
04:01:02,060 --> 04:01:02,980
And where are you?

3620
04:01:03,100 --> 04:01:03,320
Where are you?

3621
04:01:03,460 --> 04:01:03,700
Jane?

3622
04:01:04,960 --> 04:01:05,520
That's Matt.

3623
04:01:06,280 --> 04:01:06,800
There you are.

3624
04:01:06,880 --> 04:01:07,420
I need more cakes.

3625
04:01:09,920 --> 04:01:11,340
Or suspicious stews.

3626
04:01:12,320 --> 04:01:13,300
Let's have a couple of those.

3627
04:01:13,380 --> 04:01:15,660
I actually kind of want to try more of these.

3628
04:01:17,240 --> 04:01:18,280
They don't stack either.

3629
04:01:20,760 --> 04:01:21,760
Let's see what you can do now.

3630
04:01:24,810 --> 04:01:25,850
Golden carrots.

3631
04:01:26,690 --> 04:01:28,030
And you're a master now.

3632
04:01:29,810 --> 04:01:32,710
I mean... Honestly, that's kind of shitty.

3633
04:01:33,230 --> 04:01:35,930
Golden carrots are so easily made, this is terrible.

3634
04:01:40,010 --> 04:01:41,330
I'm unhappy with this.

3635
04:01:41,630 --> 04:01:41,910
Jane?

3636
04:01:43,190 --> 04:01:44,610
You had so much promise.

3637
04:01:45,030 --> 04:01:48,610
And now... Now you go ahead and do me dirty like this.

3638
04:01:49,250 --> 04:01:49,950
In Santa.

3639
04:01:50,050 --> 04:01:50,470
Let me eat this.

3640
04:01:53,200 --> 04:01:53,940
Jump boost.

3641
04:01:56,380 --> 04:01:59,820
You know what this suspicious stew can do for me?

3642
04:02:00,780 --> 04:02:05,620
It is actually a pretty good test of what kind of buffs there are in the game.

3643
04:02:05,720 --> 04:02:09,280
If this is a random buff... of all the buffs, that is, of course, assuming.

3644
04:02:11,600 --> 04:02:11,980
Again?

3645
04:02:12,240 --> 04:02:13,900
Okay, hold on, maybe it's only jump boost?

3646
04:02:26,690 --> 04:02:27,610
Okay, I don't know.

3647
04:02:30,130 --> 04:02:30,930
God damn it.

3648
04:02:31,050 --> 04:02:33,410
Also, it's a useless buff.

3649
04:02:33,970 --> 04:02:35,990
It lasts like six seconds.

3650
04:02:37,030 --> 04:02:42,310
Why would anyone ever eat the suspicious stew?

3651
04:02:43,350 --> 04:02:44,510
Maybe it's actually good food.

3652
04:02:45,910 --> 04:02:47,310
I don't know how much that heals.

3653
04:02:48,290 --> 04:02:49,270
The cookies, though.

3654
04:02:50,510 --> 04:02:52,150
Let's see if the villagers like these.

3655
04:02:54,370 --> 04:02:55,170
You like cookies?

3656
04:02:58,130 --> 04:03:01,210
Dude, oh, I would like a cookie in real life right now so bad.

3657
04:03:01,650 --> 04:03:05,170
Holy shit, I looked at that on the ground right there and I started salivating.

3658
04:03:05,430 --> 04:03:06,410
I'm not even kidding.

3659
04:03:07,650 --> 04:03:10,430
Holy shit, imagine eating a cookie right now.

3660
04:03:10,710 --> 04:03:11,090
Fuck.

3661
04:03:14,390 --> 04:03:15,490
They don't want cookies.

3662
04:03:17,310 --> 04:03:18,270
What did you want?

3663
04:03:18,370 --> 04:03:20,810
Was it... Was it meat or bread or something?

3664
04:03:21,130 --> 04:03:21,590
Apples?

3665
04:03:23,790 --> 04:03:25,330
I actually forgot what I did here.

3666
04:03:28,370 --> 04:03:29,850
I think bread for sure.

3667
04:03:33,660 --> 04:03:34,100
Here.

3668
04:03:35,440 --> 04:03:36,140
Yeah, look.

3669
04:03:36,500 --> 04:03:38,540
Yeah, he picked it up.

3670
04:03:39,700 --> 04:03:40,640
Have him, have him.

3671
04:03:41,080 --> 04:03:43,140
Eat bread and cake for the people.

3672
04:03:43,900 --> 04:03:45,460
Bread, cake and cookies.

3673
04:03:45,720 --> 04:03:46,420
For everyone.

3674
04:03:47,520 --> 04:03:48,040
Here you go.

3675
04:03:48,900 --> 04:03:50,300
This is a celebratory day.

3676
04:03:50,440 --> 04:03:51,320
Everyone gets something.

3677
04:03:52,100 --> 04:03:52,940
And you know why?

3678
04:03:53,040 --> 04:03:54,520
Because you've all been such good villagers.

3679
04:03:54,820 --> 04:03:55,700
You deserve everything.

3680
04:03:56,980 --> 04:03:59,240
Now don't forget to eat the cake before it goes bad, okay?

3681
04:04:01,240 --> 04:04:02,120
Jane made it!

3682
04:04:03,960 --> 04:04:04,740
Good stuff.

3683
04:04:05,580 --> 04:04:06,880
I think I'm a good ruler.

3684
04:04:07,100 --> 04:04:08,420
I mean, co-villager here.

3685
04:04:08,620 --> 04:04:12,580
I think my subjects, I mean my friends, are very happy with what I've been doing here.

3686
04:04:12,840 --> 04:04:14,520
You know, I'm building them railways.

3687
04:04:14,880 --> 04:04:17,300
I'm making houses for them.

3688
04:04:17,740 --> 04:04:18,820
I provide cake.

3689
04:04:19,260 --> 04:04:20,040
And you know what?

3690
04:04:20,120 --> 04:04:21,100
It's not a lie either.

3691
04:04:21,400 --> 04:04:21,860
Just saying.

3692
04:04:23,980 --> 04:04:25,780
Apples to oranges.

3693
04:04:27,240 --> 04:04:28,500
So how much does this...

3694
04:04:29,330 --> 04:04:30,850
Right, I can't test when I'm full.

3695
04:04:31,650 --> 04:04:32,070
Unfortunately.

3696
04:04:34,030 --> 04:04:34,850
Put that in there.

3697
04:04:35,090 --> 04:04:36,510
This shitty bow can go to hell.

3698
04:04:40,050 --> 04:04:40,930
What's up, Billy Bob?

3699
04:04:46,090 --> 04:04:47,490
And now we have more glass.

3700
04:04:48,630 --> 04:04:50,790
Which means also more experience.

3701
04:04:51,310 --> 04:04:52,810
Oh man, everything's coming together, huh?

3702
04:04:56,940 --> 04:04:58,140
I think I got everything.

3703
04:04:58,340 --> 04:04:59,480
Oh, there we go.

3704
04:05:00,560 --> 04:05:01,440
Need more glass.

3705
04:05:01,980 --> 04:05:07,260
I'm actually considering doing some off-stream mining now to get sand.

3706
04:05:08,600 --> 04:05:09,680
At some point, you know?

3707
04:05:10,240 --> 04:05:13,720
You know when you wake up in your underwear and you're just like... Coffee!

3708
04:05:14,320 --> 04:05:15,800
You can mine some sand, you know?

3709
04:05:16,680 --> 04:05:17,520
That'll be perfect.

3710
04:05:20,160 --> 04:05:21,300
But we have a bunch of glass.

3711
04:05:21,440 --> 04:05:22,120
This is good, this is good.

3712
04:05:22,780 --> 04:05:24,120
We can have that ready, so go.

3713
04:05:27,200 --> 04:05:29,000
Sugar in there.

3714
04:05:29,720 --> 04:05:31,060
Cookies in there.

3715
04:05:31,440 --> 04:05:32,840
All these foods.

3716
04:05:33,920 --> 04:05:35,980
How's the farming looking, Jane?

3717
04:05:37,880 --> 04:05:39,980
Oh, I'm so sorry, by the way.

3718
04:05:40,060 --> 04:05:41,020
Look at all this mess.

3719
04:05:41,900 --> 04:05:42,580
Oh, ooh.

3720
04:05:45,100 --> 04:05:48,000
Yeah, we're gonna use these.

3721
04:05:48,600 --> 04:05:50,860
And I'm specifically talking about...

3722
04:05:54,020 --> 04:05:55,520
Why did it just unlock a recipe?

3723
04:05:55,760 --> 04:05:57,880
Anyway, I'm talking about the oxidized versions.

3724
04:05:58,560 --> 04:06:01,520
Because they're kind of ocean-colored, right?

3725
04:06:01,940 --> 04:06:03,860
We can have those along the path.

3726
04:06:04,680 --> 04:06:08,300
Detector rails along the way turns on.

3727
04:06:09,480 --> 04:06:17,580
And we're going to have it made so that one or between two and four of these lamps are going to turn off, given where you are.

3728
04:06:17,740 --> 04:06:19,520
So, like, two in front of you, two behind you.

3729
04:06:19,800 --> 04:06:23,100
So there's always a section of the railway that is, like, lit.

3730
04:06:23,720 --> 04:06:25,900
You know, it's not just when you run over it.

3731
04:06:25,980 --> 04:06:27,620
It's, like, around you in a sphere.

3732
04:06:28,360 --> 04:06:29,820
If you understand what I mean.

3733
04:06:30,360 --> 04:06:31,420
That could be really dope.

3734
04:06:31,680 --> 04:06:33,680
Now here, we gotta help out Jane a little bit.

3735
04:06:34,160 --> 04:06:35,480
Shit, that's not helping out.

3736
04:06:35,560 --> 04:06:36,180
That's making it worse.

3737
04:06:36,380 --> 04:06:36,940
This is a path.

3738
04:06:38,260 --> 04:06:39,020
I fucked up.

3739
04:06:45,540 --> 04:06:46,840
Gotta make this real nice.

3740
04:06:53,840 --> 04:06:56,180
Utility... The golden hole with mending, why not?

3741
04:07:02,520 --> 04:07:04,660
We gotta restore the former glory of this place.

3742
04:07:06,840 --> 04:07:08,320
Okay, this one is not doing anything.

3743
04:07:09,840 --> 04:07:11,600
This one is bullshit, I hate that.

3744
04:07:14,670 --> 04:07:16,590
We need proper something.

3745
04:07:17,130 --> 04:07:17,650
Let's see.

3746
04:07:19,430 --> 04:07:23,470
I think we're gonna plant carrots, actually.

3747
04:07:24,210 --> 04:07:24,870
Wait, wait, wait, wait.

3748
04:07:25,030 --> 04:07:26,630
We're gonna plant the thing that makes people happy.

3749
04:07:27,410 --> 04:07:30,410
Ah, but I already leveled Jane up, so it doesn't matter.

3750
04:07:31,370 --> 04:07:33,050
Let's get the thing that heals the most.

3751
04:07:33,190 --> 04:07:34,330
Maybe potatoes are a good thing.

3752
04:07:35,770 --> 04:07:36,610
Yeah, I like that.

3753
04:07:37,370 --> 04:07:37,750
Taters.

3754
04:07:55,430 --> 04:07:57,150
Did... Did this just grow?

3755
04:07:57,370 --> 04:07:59,190
It wasn't there when I was there just before.

3756
04:08:00,170 --> 04:08:01,530
What the fuck just happened?

3757
04:08:03,170 --> 04:08:04,970
That's a hella mystery right there.

3758
04:08:05,090 --> 04:08:06,310
I don't... I don't understand.

3759
04:08:07,250 --> 04:08:07,630
Huh.

3760
04:08:08,010 --> 04:08:08,450
Sure.

3761
04:08:08,670 --> 04:08:09,030
Whatever.

3762
04:08:11,570 --> 04:08:12,670
Oh, it's the wrong one.

3763
04:08:12,790 --> 04:08:12,970
Damn.

3764
04:08:13,110 --> 04:08:13,450
What are these?

3765
04:08:13,550 --> 04:08:13,830
What are these?

3766
04:08:13,990 --> 04:08:14,270
What are these?

3767
04:08:14,370 --> 04:08:16,890
These are... Spruce logs.

3768
04:08:17,110 --> 04:08:17,290
Okay.

3769
04:08:19,630 --> 04:08:20,450
I got you.

3770
04:08:20,530 --> 04:08:20,990
I got you.

3771
04:08:21,410 --> 04:08:22,170
Sup, Rosie?

3772
04:08:22,920 --> 04:08:24,560
Billy Bop, good to see you.

3773
04:08:26,260 --> 04:08:28,060
Give me spruce.

3774
04:08:28,800 --> 04:08:29,300
Yeah.

3775
04:08:30,620 --> 04:08:32,260
Oh no!

3776
04:08:35,380 --> 04:08:36,120
Okay, it's fine.

3777
04:08:36,280 --> 04:08:38,080
I don't know why I panicked so much.

3778
04:08:38,240 --> 04:08:39,720
It's not even a big problem.

3779
04:08:40,660 --> 04:08:41,600
Oh my god.

3780
04:08:42,240 --> 04:08:45,000
Why did I just have such a visceral reaction to that?

3781
04:08:49,020 --> 04:08:52,000
It's like everything just came to... I don't know.

3782
04:08:52,880 --> 04:08:56,420
For some reason, the whole world got destroyed for me right there when that happened.

3783
04:08:57,200 --> 04:08:58,200
Oh no.

3784
04:08:58,760 --> 04:08:59,780
Let's get rid of this one.

3785
04:09:00,690 --> 04:09:03,710
And do that, and then we're gonna put it somewhere nice.

3786
04:09:04,190 --> 04:09:05,010
Like, I don't even know.

3787
04:09:05,470 --> 04:09:05,690
Here.

3788
04:09:06,050 --> 04:09:06,570
That's nice.

3789
04:09:07,430 --> 04:09:08,170
That's nice!

3790
04:09:08,850 --> 04:09:09,510
What's this?

3791
04:09:23,470 --> 04:09:27,590
I just had a crazy thought, guys.

3792
04:09:30,980 --> 04:09:34,840
We make a remote-controlled cat with levers.

3793
04:09:35,580 --> 04:09:37,160
But we need at least 14.

3794
04:09:37,460 --> 04:09:38,380
Fuck, how many do I have?

3795
04:09:40,520 --> 04:09:41,100
Levers?

3796
04:09:42,740 --> 04:09:44,700
Ooh, we could also use a tripwire.

3797
04:09:47,300 --> 04:09:48,160
Tripwire setup?

3798
04:09:57,600 --> 04:09:58,620
It's not gonna work.

3799
04:10:01,660 --> 04:10:02,720
Nah, it's not gonna work.

3800
04:10:03,580 --> 04:10:04,420
We can't do it.

3801
04:10:04,840 --> 04:10:06,400
I'm sorry, Rosie.

3802
04:10:07,540 --> 04:10:08,920
I wanted to make you a friend.

3803
04:10:09,500 --> 04:10:10,580
It can't happen, though.

3804
04:10:11,280 --> 04:10:12,840
Instead, we're gonna do the next best thing.

3805
04:10:23,040 --> 04:10:25,280
Come on, how dare you play music while I'm doing this.

3806
04:10:37,270 --> 04:10:38,430
Look at my village.

3807
04:10:39,170 --> 04:10:40,210
It's thriving.

3808
04:10:40,830 --> 04:10:42,410
People are eating potatoes.

3809
04:10:42,810 --> 04:10:43,410
They're eating bread.

3810
04:10:43,810 --> 04:10:44,690
There's cake.

3811
04:10:44,910 --> 04:10:45,550
There's cookies.

3812
04:10:46,070 --> 04:10:47,170
You know what that means, right?

3813
04:10:49,070 --> 04:10:50,110
There's extra.

3814
04:10:50,690 --> 04:10:51,790
There's overflow.

3815
04:10:52,390 --> 04:10:53,510
Happiness overflow.

3816
04:10:54,250 --> 04:10:55,510
Billy Bob is protecting us.

3817
04:10:56,470 --> 04:10:59,550
None of the villagers have died in a long time.

3818
04:10:59,990 --> 04:11:02,170
This place is as safe as can be.

3819
04:11:02,990 --> 04:11:04,450
The flower is open.

3820
04:11:06,720 --> 04:11:07,740
Does it get any better?

3821
04:11:08,080 --> 04:11:09,080
Railway is coming.

3822
04:11:09,540 --> 04:11:12,580
ODB is slumming.

3823
04:11:14,220 --> 04:11:15,160
Actually, kind of weird.

3824
04:11:15,260 --> 04:11:16,340
ODB is over here, not up there.

3825
04:11:17,640 --> 04:11:19,000
But this is a great time.

3826
04:11:19,360 --> 04:11:21,720
And we need to appreciate these times as well, okay?

3827
04:11:23,020 --> 04:11:24,920
Don't always think about the bad times.

3828
04:11:25,640 --> 04:11:28,980
Put a benchmark in your life if things are going well.

3829
04:11:29,400 --> 04:11:30,680
And this is one of those times.

3830
04:11:43,690 --> 04:11:44,310
We're back!

3831
04:11:53,490 --> 04:11:54,570
Reminder to unmute music?

3832
04:11:54,770 --> 04:11:57,650
Well, I just turned music down to zero, so I don't think we're gonna have a problem with that.

3833
04:12:00,900 --> 04:12:02,860
Ads go on during whole speech, typical.

3834
04:12:03,180 --> 04:12:11,140
Okay, dude, I actually don't know this, but when it comes to ads on Twitch, do they play at the same time for everyone, or is it an individual thing?

3835
04:12:12,440 --> 04:12:16,700
Is everyone on different ad timers, or is it a collective ad timing?

3836
04:12:22,720 --> 04:12:23,640
Everyone at once?

3837
04:12:23,920 --> 04:12:24,320
Okay.

3838
04:12:25,520 --> 04:12:27,760
Reminder to run ads during... Oh, fuck.

3839
04:12:28,280 --> 04:12:29,180
I didn't do that.

3840
04:12:31,060 --> 04:12:31,860
I fucked up.

3841
04:12:34,800 --> 04:12:37,020
By the way, how long has it been since you backed up your world?

3842
04:12:37,180 --> 04:12:37,900
Quite a while.

3843
04:12:38,020 --> 04:12:38,560
Let me do it now.

3844
04:12:38,860 --> 04:12:40,200
Thanks for pointing that out.

3845
04:12:43,020 --> 04:12:43,820
Hold on.

3846
04:12:45,020 --> 04:12:46,480
Minecraft, uh, edit.

3847
04:12:47,280 --> 04:12:48,180
Make backup.

3848
04:12:48,840 --> 04:12:49,880
I'm doing it now.

3849
04:12:50,780 --> 04:12:52,800
Actually, very, very good point.

3850
04:12:53,040 --> 04:12:53,880
We should do it.

3851
04:12:56,980 --> 04:13:01,840
You could name your timer with a reminder for... Oh, actually, that's a great idea, Kathleen Highlights.

3852
04:13:03,600 --> 04:13:04,660
That is fantastic.

3853
04:13:07,580 --> 04:13:08,180
Thank you.

3854
04:13:08,320 --> 04:13:09,520
I will definitely do that.

3855
04:13:12,280 --> 04:13:13,600
What's my favorite TV show?

3856
04:13:13,740 --> 04:13:14,900
Oh, that's a difficult one.

3857
04:13:15,420 --> 04:13:16,940
Can I just give you one I really like?

3858
04:13:18,340 --> 04:13:19,600
I don't think I have a favorite.

3859
04:13:22,290 --> 04:13:23,030
I don't know.

