3965
04:19:12,620 --> 04:19:13,500
Ascension blocks, right?

3966
04:19:15,000 --> 04:19:16,220
It's very nice.

3967
04:19:17,620 --> 04:19:18,480
Not diorite?

3968
04:19:18,580 --> 04:19:19,860
No, definitely not diorite.

3969
04:19:20,300 --> 04:19:21,380
That is not my favorite.

3970
04:19:25,420 --> 04:19:28,160
I probably will be watching the Minecraft movie just for the memes.

3971
04:19:29,260 --> 04:19:32,440
Just so I can catch up on what all the young people are saying and memeing about.

3972
04:19:36,680 --> 04:19:38,020
What about favorite item?

3973
04:19:38,180 --> 04:19:38,640
Spyglass.

3974
04:19:38,940 --> 04:19:40,580
