3975
04:19:41,920 --> 04:19:45,280
I cannot imagine playing Minecraft without the Spyglass, guys.

3976
04:19:47,200 --> 04:19:49,720
I can easily imagine playing without the Elytra.

3977
04:19:50,040 --> 04:19:53,860
I can imagine playing without... Okay, okay.

3978
04:19:54,100 --> 04:19:57,940
Pickaxe, I can't imagine playing without, but, you know, other than the absolute necessities.

3979
04:20:01,360 --> 04:20:02,280
Favorite mob?

3980
04:20:03,460 --> 04:20:05,020
Let me see.

3981
04:20:08,120 --> 04:20:09,360
Hmm... I don't know.

3982
04:20:12,240 --> 04:20:13,300
I actually don't know.

3983
04:20:13,440 --> 04:20:14,080
I've never thought of it.

3984
04:20:16,860 --> 04:20:18,820
Something that is satisfying to kill, maybe.

3985
04:20:26,160 --> 04:20:27,000
Maybe ODB.

3986
04:20:27,240 --> 04:20:28,600
I love ODB very much.

3987
04:20:29,040 --> 04:20:29,860
Yeah, Amardillo!

3988
04:20:30,080 --> 04:20:30,500
Exactly!

3989
04:20:31,220 --> 04:20:32,400
I was just about to say.

3990
04:20:37,550 --> 04:20:41,310
I just love looking at them, the way they're going and going, the sounds they make and everything.

3991
04:20:42,670 --> 04:20:43,610
Endermen are cool, yeah.

3992
04:20:45,150 --> 04:20:46,610
Hive losing power on their birthday.

3993
04:20:46,730 --> 04:20:48,150
Wait, it's your birthday, Hive?

3994
04:20:48,670 --> 04:20:49,650
Happy birthday, man!

3995
04:20:53,110 --> 04:20:54,530
Your favorite is the silverfish.

3996
04:20:54,630 --> 04:20:55,350
What the fuck is that?

3997
04:20:56,010 --> 04:20:56,810
Have I seen that?

3998
04:21:02,220 --> 04:21:04,480
Oh, I thought it actually was.

3999
04:21:05,400 --> 04:21:06,620
God damn it.

