I'm sorry.

4002
04:21:09,620 --> 04:21:11,880
I thought it was legitimately your birthday.

4003
04:21:13,240 --> 04:21:14,760
Sucks to hear your power went out.

4004
04:21:21,340 --> 04:21:22,540
It'll never end.

4005
04:21:24,620 --> 04:21:25,680
It's next month?

4006
04:21:25,880 --> 04:21:26,360
Ah, okay.

4007
04:21:30,470 --> 04:21:32,750
Silverfish is the tiny silver fish-looking bugs.

4008
04:21:33,930 --> 04:21:35,570
You mean the ones that come out of the wall?

4009
04:21:38,110 --> 04:21:39,770
The little that take one hit to kill?

