04:21:43,470 --> 04:21:44,690
Favorite animal in real life?

4011
04:21:44,830 --> 04:21:45,750
Probably dogs or cats.

4012
04:21:45,990 --> 04:21:46,910
It's a boring answer.

4013
04:21:51,510 --> 04:21:53,850
But it's one of those things I haven't really thought about.

4014
04:21:55,030 --> 04:21:55,650
Favorite dog?

4015
04:21:55,790 --> 04:21:56,390
Golden Retriever.

4016
04:22:00,360 --> 04:22:01,940
I just love golden retrievers.

4017
04:22:02,040 --> 04:22:02,560
They're so cute.

4018
04:22:02,660 --> 04:22:03,900
It looks like they're always smiling.

4019
04:22:05,020 --> 04:22:05,660
Love them.

4020
04:22:06,920 --> 04:22:07,640
Favorite, favorite?

4021
04:22:07,900 --> 04:22:08,560
Uh, favorite.

4022
04:22:15,440 --> 04:22:16,280
Okay, guys.

4023
04:22:17,740 --> 04:22:19,840
I feel like I should start asking questions now.

4024
04:22:20,120 --> 04:22:21,240
I'm being interrogated here.

4025
04:22:22,400 --> 04:22:23,060
Favorite cookie?

4026
04:22:23,200 --> 04:22:23,700
The standard.

4027
04:22:24,060 --> 04:22:24,820
American one.

4028
04:22:27,340 --> 04:22:28,400
Least favorite mob?

4029
04:22:28,540 --> 04:22:28,700
Oh!

4030
04:22:30,140 --> 04:22:31,460
That's a lot easier.

4031
04:22:33,940 --> 04:22:34,900
Probably skeleton.

4032
04:22:35,220 --> 04:22:37,040
I'm not gonna say creeper.

4033
04:22:37,360 --> 04:22:39,300
I think the skeleton is my least favorite.

4034
04:22:39,860 --> 04:22:41,780
I fucking hate those bastards.

4035
04:22:49,280 --> 04:22:53,300
I hate the way they have infinite precision with their aiming.

4036
04:22:53,760 --> 04:22:55,220
They shoot so quick.

4037
04:22:55,980 --> 04:22:58,500
And they just have punchable faces too.

4038
04:22:59,480 --> 04:23:00,340
I hate them.

4039
04:23:01,160 --> 04:23:02,540
I want to break their bones.

4040
04:23:06,680 --> 04:23:08,720
You're lucky you live in a post-shield Minecraft.

4041
04:23:08,960 --> 04:23:13,940
Are you telling me there was a point in time where there were skeletons and no shields?

4042
04:23:19,950 --> 04:23:20,750
Holy fuck!

4043
04:23:25,710 --> 04:23:28,310
Okay, that sounds absolutely horrendous.

4044
04:23:31,470 --> 04:23:33,150
